  mobileMessageText: Each position has two unique abilities. Starting with cf, the
    powerkick ability allows you to shoot with a greater power, provided that you
    time the shooting bar well. to get a perfect timing, you must release when the
    bar touches the white part. you can activiate it by pressing the "L" button twice.
